<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When we plead the Name of Jesus,</l><l>Satan and his hosts must flee.</l><l>Jesus! Jesus! Precious Jesus!</l><l>In Thy Name is victory.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Soon shall come the blessed moment</l><l>When the battle shall be won,</l><l>When the Mighty Name of Jesus</l><l>Shall exalt us to the throne.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
